sequenceDiagram
  participant V as Visiteur
  participant S as Capteur IoT
  participant UC as ValidateTicketUseCase
  participant TR as TicketRepository
  participant MP as MqttEventPublisher
  participant D as Dashboard

  V->>S: Présente billet TKT-2026-FAKE-999
  S->>S: onTicketDetected() → READING
  S->>UC: execute("TKT-2026-FAKE-999")
  UC->>TR: findById(ticketId)
  TR-->>UC: null (ticket inexistant)
  UC-->>S: { isValid: false, reason: INVALID }
  S->>S: onReadSuccess() → PROCESSING
  S->>MP: publish(AccessEvent DENIED, ticketStatus=INVALID)
  MP->>D: broadcast via WebSocket
  D->>D: appendEvent(DENIED, TKT-2026-FAKE-999)
  S->>S: onAccessDenied() → DENIED
  Note over S: 3 secondes
  S->>S: onReset() → IDLE
